      "html": "Stacey Ryan’s previous artist website no longer reflected her evolving brand or artistic vision. As she entered a new era with <mark>Blessing in Disguise</mark>, her online presence needed a refresh. Thus, I was tasked with transforming an outdated site into a cinematic, vintage magazine-inspired experience that aligned with her new aesthetic while keeping music, tour dates, and merch at the forefront for fans."
